@startuml
' --- gaya At Cell (inline, mandiri utk server publik) ---
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam titleFontSize 18
skinparam titleFontStyle bold
skinparam headerFontSize 11
skinparam footerFontSize 11
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam noteBorderColor #B89B00
skinparam actorBackgroundColor #E8EEF7
skinparam actorBorderColor #0B4ED8
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #E8EEF7
skinparam participantBorderColor #0B4ED8
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #E8EEF7
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #0B4ED8
skinparam classBackgroundColor #E8EEF7
skinparam classBorderColor #0B4ED8
skinparam objectBackgroundColor #EEF3FA
skinparam objectBorderColor #0B4ED8
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #E8EEF7
skinparam activityBorderColor #0B4ED8
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #0B4ED8
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #E8EEF7
skinparam stateBorderColor #0B4ED8
skinparam stateStartColor #0B4ED8
skinparam stateEndColor #0B4ED8
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #E8EEF7
skinparam componentBorderColor #0B4ED8
skinparam cloudBackgroundColor #F2F5FA
skinparam cloudBorderColor #5B6B82
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #E8EEF7
skinparam databaseBorderColor #0B4ED8
skinparam entityBackgroundColor #E8EEF7
skinparam entityBorderColor #0B4ED8
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #334155
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #0B4ED8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #0B4ED8
footer Dipelihara di docs/diagram-uml, render dari sumber .puml
title Teknisi masuk lalu kerjakan tiket servis
autonumber
actor Teknisi as T
participant "Peramban" as UI
participant "Middleware" as MW
participant "Otentikasi" as AU
participant "Server" as SV
participant "Basis Data" as DB
participant "Penyimpanan" as ST

== Masuk dan dibuka ke meja servis ==
T -> UI : Buka /id/login
alt Mode demo
  T -> UI : Pilih akun demo teknisi
  UI -> UI : Ganti peran ke technician tanpa password
  UI -> MW : Minta /portal/service
  MW --> UI : Izin karena servis boleh admin, sales, technician
else Mode live
  T -> UI : Isi username dan password
  UI -> AU : Kirim kredensial
  AU --> UI : Sesi dan cookie
  UI -> MW : Minta halaman portal
  MW -> DB : Baca peran profil
  DB --> MW : peran technician
  MW --> UI : Teruskan ke /portal/service
end

== Buat tiket servis ==
T -> UI : Isi nama, telepon, model, IMEI atau SN, keluhan
UI -> SV : Kirim foto awal
SV -> ST : Simpan ke bucket foto servis
ST --> SV : Alamat foto
UI -> SV : Ajukan tiket baru
SV -> DB : Simpan tiket servis
note right of DB
  Pemicu BEFORE INSERT menerbitkan kode
  tiket SRV-YYYYMMDD-XXXXXXXX atomik.
end note
DB --> SV : Tiket status awal received
SV --> UI : Tiket tersimpan
UI --> T : Tampilkan resi

== Update workflow dan biaya ==
T -> UI : Buka /portal/service, pilih tiket
UI -> SV : Minta detail tiket
SV -> DB : Baca tiket servis
DB --> SV : Detail tiket
SV --> UI : Detail tiket
loop Setiap perpindahan status
  note over T,DB
    Urutan: received, diagnosing, waiting_approval,
    in_progress, testing, completed, picked_up.
    testing boleh kembali ke in_progress bila gagal uji.
  end note
  T -> UI : Pilih status berikut, isi biaya sparepart, jasa, catatan
  UI -> SV : Kirim foto bukti
  SV -> ST : Simpan ke bucket foto servis
  ST --> SV : Alamat foto
  UI -> SV : Ajukan update tiket
  SV -> DB : Ubah status dan biaya plus rincian maks 50 baris
  alt Peran admin atau technician dan transisi valid
    DB --> SV : OK, total sama dengan sparepart plus jasa
    SV --> UI : Tiket diperbarui
    UI --> T : Tampilkan status dan total terbaru
  else Peran atau transisi tidak valid
    SV --> UI : Ditolak requireRole atau transisi tidak valid
    UI --> T : Update tidak diizinkan
  end
end

== Catat serah terima unit ==
T -> UI : Pelanggan datang, buka tiket completed
UI -> SV : Centang konfirmasi nota servis
SV -> SV : Pastikan status completed dan nota dikonfirmasi
SV -> DB : Ubah status completed ke picked_up plus waktu serah terima
DB --> SV : OK
SV --> UI : Tiket tertutup
UI --> T : Unit keluar dari antrean aktif
note right of T
  Sales hanya boleh mencatat tiket masuk.
  Status dan biaya hanya admin dan teknisi.
end note
@enduml
